      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scottsbluff%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Scottsbluff is the largest city in the Nebraska Panhandle and the 13th‑most‑populous city in Nebraska.",
